{
  "info": {
    "name": "Producer API Collection - Advanced Size Management",
    "description": "Complete API collection untuk Producer role dengan Advanced-Only Size Management System. Includes produk, kategori, warna, material, dan advanced size management (atomic switch implementation).\n\n🆕 ADVANCED-ONLY ARCHITECTURE:\n• All products now require sizes dengan age categories (ADULT/CHILD/UNIVERSAL)\n• Aggregated size display dengan breakdown capabilities\n• Business logic validation dan performance monitoring\n• Pure advanced architecture: no legacy single-size support\n• Real-time aggregation dengan caching (5min TTL)\n\n🔗 DEPENDENCIES & EXECUTION ORDER:\n1. Setup: Login → Get session token\n2. Prerequisites: Create Category → Create Color → (Optional) Create Material\n3. Products: Create/Update products dengan advanced size management\n4. Size Management: Test aggregation, validation, advanced scenarios\n5. Testing: Run comprehensive integration scenarios\n\n📋 REQUIRED VARIABLES:\n- base_url: http://localhost:3000\n- clerk_session_token: From browser cookies\n- Auto-captured: product_id, category_id, color_id, material_id, size_id\n\n⚡ PERFORMANCE TARGETS:\n- Aggregation: <50ms calculation time\n- Cache Hit Rate: >80% untuk optimal performance\n- Response Time: <2s SLA maintained\n\n📚 Full documentation: docs/api/manage-product-endpoints.md | docs/api/manage-product-business-logic.md",
    "version": "4.0.0",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "cookie",
    "cookie": [
      {
        "key": "__session",
        "value": "{{clerk_session_token}}",
        "description": "Clerk session token dari browser"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "description": "Base URL aplikasi"
    },
    {
      "key": "product_id",
      "value": "",
      "description": "ID produk untuk testing"
    },
    {
      "key": "category_id",
      "value": "",
      "description": "ID kategori untuk testing"
    },
    {
      "key": "color_id",
      "value": "",
      "description": "ID warna untuk testing"
    },
    {
      "key": "material_id",
      "value": "",
      "description": "ID material untuk testing"
    },
    {
      "key": "size_id",
      "value": "",
      "description": "ID size untuk advanced size management testing"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Material Management",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get All Materials",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/materials?page=1&limit=10&search=&isActive=true&unit=meter,piece",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "materials"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1",
                  "description": "Halaman yang diminta (default: 1)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "10",
                  "description": "Jumlah item per halaman (default: 10)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "search",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "Pencarian berdasarkan nama material"
                },
                {
                  "key": "isActive",
                  "value": "true",
                  "description": "Filter material aktif/nonaktif (default: true)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "unit",
                  "value": "meter,piece",
                  "description": "Filter berdasarkan satuan (multiple values separated by comma)"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Mendapatkan daftar material dengan pagination dan filter untuk manajemen material"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Materials List Response",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
